      "KindleState": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "queued",
          "converted",
          "sent",
          "failed"
        ],
        "title": "KindleState",
        "description": "Lifecycle of one web novel on its way to the Kindle over USB.\n\nThe Kindle is never online, so nothing here can be pushed \u2014 a row sits in\n``QUEUED`` until ``scripts/kindle-sync`` runs on the Mac with the device\nplugged in. ``CONVERTED`` means an AZW3 exists in the outbox (the Kindle\ncannot read EPUB); ``SENT`` means it was copied onto the device."
      },
